### 1. 로그인 (토큰 저장)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/member/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=user2@aaa.com&password=1111

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 2. 담기
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart/change
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"user2@aaa.com","pno":1,"qty":2}

### 3. 목록
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cart/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
